TITLE: Delivered aircraft sources, example, and requirements
STATEMENT: >>>
The product specification shall list the Aircraft CSCI artifacts delivered in this version: the Python package under apps/aircraft, the example file config/n123ab.toml, the closed phrase set in the phrase book, the StrictDoc sources under reqs/aircraft and reqs/grammar.sgra, and the make aircraft-test target. The byte encoding of the tower link remains unselected. Acceptance is a reader finding each of those paths in the version that this specification describes.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The product specification is the inventory of what this version contains.
<<<
DAL: E
